+---
+id: task-004-let-customers-rent-equipment-by-the-hour
+type: task
+title: "Let customers rent equipment by the hour"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+<!-- task body. `wingfoil memory add` copies this scaffold, setting only `id`, `title` and
