+     these placeholder comments yourself; `wingfoil memory submit` then checks the required fields,
+     moves `status` forward and commits the document as you left it, naming in the commit body the
+     content it carries. -->
+
+Customers can rent by the hour. `addEquipment` accepts an optional `hourlyPrice` (integer euro cents,
+validated like `dailyPrice`). A rental shorter than a day that starts and ends on the hour costs
+hours x `hourlyPrice`; an item without an hourly price is refused for such a rental. See dl-003. In
+`src/index.ts`: `parseRentalPeriod` and `rentalTotal`. Tests added in `test/rental.test.ts`
+(red-first, new behaviour): pricing, crossing midnight, no hourly price, off-hour and non-UTC-hour
+instants, day-or-longer rentals still on whole days, overlap, hourlyPrice validation; all pass.
